				\begin{document}$$\:SFS={FS}_{j},where{{Best}_{MCC}}_{j}={(MCC}_{k})$$\end{document}

Prediction results were evaluated with various measures including accuracy, precision, recall (or sensitivity), F1-score, and MCC defined as follows.4\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
